    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Forge-Heart Anchor.</strong> You can root yourself and your work so deeply into a site that reality has to argue with you to move it.</p><ul><li>When you choose to <strong>anchor yourself</strong> to a specific hex, workshop, or bastion you have significantly worked on, you gain the following benefits while defending it:</li><li>• reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being <strong>pushed, knocked prone, or forcibly moved</strong>.</li><li>• A +1 bonus to <strong>Guard, Evasion and Resolve</strong> while inside the anchored location (toggle the Forge-Heart Anchor effect on while you are anchored).</li><li>• At the GM’s discretion, minor hostile hex mutations or destructive Turn Requests targeting that location may have their impact reduced or downgraded while you are present.</li></ul>",
